{"track":"python","category":"함수·클래스","level":2,"title":"안전한 나눗셈 (예외 처리)","desc":"<p><code>a</code>를 <code>b</code>로 나눈 값을 돌려주되, <code>b</code>가 0이면 에러가 나는 대신 <code>None</code>을 돌려주는 <code>safe_divide(a, b)</code>를 만드세요. <code>try</code> / <code>except</code>를 써 보세요.</p>","starter":"def safe_divide(a, b):\n    pass\n","solution":"def safe_divide(a, b):\n    try:\n        return a / b\n    except ZeroDivisionError:\n        return None\n","hint":"<p><code>try:</code> 안에서 계산하고 <code>except ZeroDivisionError:</code> 에서 <code>None</code>을 돌려줘요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"safe_divide(10, 2)","expected":5,"visible":true},{"call":"safe_divide(1, 0)","expected":null,"visible":true},{"call":"safe_divide(7, 2)","expected":3.5,"visible":false},{"call":"safe_divide(0, 5)","expected":0,"visible":false},{"call":"safe_divide(-9, 3)","expected":-3,"visible":false}],"id":"py-084"}